  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tdr1](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tdr1) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 98.098 depth occurred on Sep 02 2026 52km W of Anelgaohat. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -20.2919 longitude 169.319. It impacted 105 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
